    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42303" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέπτομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feed on,</i> c. acc., only in pres.
			part., mostly of granivorous animals, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτόν, κρῖ λευκόν, πυρὸν ἐρεπτόμενοι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.776
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				5.196
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.553
			</span></i>, al.; of men, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λωτὸν ἐ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.97
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				9.618
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυν</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				7.20
			</span></i> ; of fish, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δημὸν ἐ.</span>
			<i>feeding on</i> the fat of a carcase, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				21.204
			</span></i>.—
				Ep.
			 Verb, used burlesquely by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				1295
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρεπτόμενον τὰ τῶν ἐχόντων</span>:—
				Act.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐρέπτω</span>”
				<i>eat,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nonn.
					<u>D.</u>
					40.306
				</span></i>
			 ; also causal,=<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρέφω,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
